# Release check for tiny-ruby-lib

Dependencies are installed with `bundle install` and the tests run with `bundle exec rspec`.
See the [testing guide](https://rspec.info/) and the [contributing notes](https://github.com/steplet-corpus/tiny-ruby-lib/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).

Report the summary line exactly as printed.
